{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2021-12-22 09:05:00', 'title': 'SYNOPSYS CHOSEN BY JUNIPER NETWORKS TO ACCELERATE DEVELOPMENT OF PHOTONIC ICS FOR NEXT-GEN DATA CENTERS', 'text': 'MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF., DEC. 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 SYNOPSYS, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT JUNIPER NETWORKS, A LEADER IN SECURE, AI-DRIVEN NETWORKS, HAS ADOPTED THE SYNOPSYS OPTOCOMPILER™ PLATFORM, INCLUDING THE OPTSIM™ AND PRIMESIM™ HSPICE® SIMULATION SOLUTIONS, TO ACCELERATE THE DEVELOPMENT OF PHOTONIC-ENABLED CHIPS FOR THE NEXT GENERATION OF OPTICAL COMMUNICATIONS.'}